## Upstream services retained

URLs pointing at `opentraderworld.com`, `demo.opentraderworld.com` and
`get.opentraderworld.com` are references to upstream's live documentation, demo and
install endpoints. They are intentionally **not** renamed, because those hosts are
operated by the upstream project and renaming them would produce dead links.

