## Internal identifiers

Internal identifiers retain the upstream `otw` prefix (`otw-core`, `otw-store`,
`OTW_SECRET_KEY`, `otw_mcp_*`). These are private implementation details, deliberately
not renamed, to keep database migrations, issued MCP tokens and existing deployment
configuration stable across the rebrand.
